<section class="intro cmp-intro"><span class="eyebrow gold">V1.6 · SCIENTIFIC MODEL COMPARISON</span><h1>Change one assumption.<br>Compare the consequences.</h1><p class="lead">Sweep a physical parameter, retain an explicit reference, and compare compatible observables. Explore which outcomes change, which remain fixed, and where a proposed model encounters a constraint.</p><p>Seven guided investigations · 15 existing solvers · up to 65 samples per sweep.</p></section><section class="section"><h2>Choose an investigation</h2><div class="cmp-presets"><?php foreach(presets() as $k=>$v):?><a class="panel preset-link" href="/model-comparison/?preset=<?=h($k)?>" <?=$id===$k?'aria-current="true"':''?>><strong><?=h($v['title'])?></strong><small><?=h($v['description'])?></small></a><?php endforeach;?></div></section>
<section class="section panel"><h2>Configure the experiment</h2><p>Compare the same metric across parameter settings, or one of three predefined metric pairs representing compatible quantities. A fixed reference does not follow the sweep; a matched reference does.</p><?php if($error):?><p class="notice error" role="alert"><?=h($error)?></p><?php endif;?><form method="post" action="/model-comparison/" id="cmp-form"><div id="cmp-editor" hidden></div><details open id="recipe-details"><summary>Editable JSON recipe</summary><label for="cmp-plan">Sweep plan (also works without JavaScript)</label><textarea id="cmp-plan" name="recipe" rows="14" required maxlength="65536" spellcheck="false"><?=h($raw)?></textarea></details><div class="actions"><button type="submit">Calculate sweep</button><label class="cmp-file" id="cmp-import-label" hidden>Import recipe or result<input type="file" id="cmp-import" accept=".json,application/json"></label><button type="button" id="cmp-reset" class="secondary" hidden>Restore loaded recipe</button></div><p role="status" id="cmp-status">Calculations run on the server. Imported results are never trusted.</p></form></section><?php if($r)result($r);?><script type="application/json" id="cmp-catalog"><?=j(catalog())?></script><?php foot();
